  - nodeId: 3
    spanishLine: "\xBFD\xF3nde ________ (estar) las m\xE1quinas de boletos?"
    englishHint: 'Estar: Yo(I) - Estoy, Tu(You) - Estas, El/Ella/Usted (He/She/You(Formal)
      - Esta, Nosotros (We) - Estamos, Ellos/Ellas/Ustedes (They/Them/You All) -
      Estan. Remember, a ticket machine in Spanish Grammar is a she, but we are talking
      about multiple machines.'
